# Sao chep file nay thanh .env roi dien API key that vao (KHONG commit .env).
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Lay key tai: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# key1 -> phien Sensei (Gemini Live: giang bai, doi thoai truc tiep qua audio)
# key2 -> dan dien vien long tieng + soan de (goi model van ban, tao giong doc)
# key3, key4 -> du phong. Dien duoc toi da 4 key (4 tai khoan khac nhau);
#   khi soan de bang AI het quota (429) tren mot key, app tu dong xoay sang
#   key ke tiep con trong danh sach; dan dien vien long tieng cung xoay key
#   tuong tu sau khi da thu het cac model du phong.
#
# Cac key co the trung nhau (dung chung 1-2 key cho moi vai tro) hoac tach
# rieng moi vai 1 tai khoan de chia tai quota. Chi can dien it nhat 1 key —
# cac o con lai de trong cung duoc, code se tu bo qua o rong.
GEMINI_KEY1=
GEMINI_KEY2=
GEMINI_KEY3=
GEMINI_KEY4=